---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — SoftStack" description="Privacy Policy for SoftStack">
  <div class="page-container">
  <nav class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span>
    Privacy Policy
  </nav>

  <article style="max-width:var(--content);margin:0 auto">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--gap-lg)">Last updated: July 24, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>We collect nothing.</strong> SoftStack is a static website. We do not use cookies, analytics, tracking scripts, or any form of user data collection. There is no login, no account, no database.</p>

    <h2>2. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>SoftStack loads Font Awesome icons from a CDN (cdnjs.cloudflare.com) for visual elements. The CDN provider may collect standard server logs (IP address, browser type) as part of content delivery. We do not have access to this data.</p>

    <h2>3. External Links</h2>
    <p>When you click a link to an external website or software download, you are subject to that site's privacy policy. SoftStack has no control over third-party privacy practices.</p>

    <h2>4. Hosting</h2>
    <p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process visitor requests as part of content delivery and DDoS protection. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>SoftStack does not knowingly collect information from anyone under 13 years of age.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. Changes will be posted here.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@softstack.cc">support@softstack.cc</a>.</p>
  </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
